/**
 * Phase-0 frozen integration contracts — registry + freeze verification
 * (IMP-00 items 12–13; master plan §8.2, §12 contract-change rule).
 *
 * `contract-manifest.json` (sibling file, generated by `generateManifest.ts`,
 * committed) pins { name, version, hash } for every contract. The
 * contracts-freeze test recomputes hashes from the live descriptors and fails
 * on ANY divergence, so a parallel work package cannot silently redefine a
 * shared interface: it must bump the version, regenerate the manifest, and
 * surface the diff for integration review.
 */

